  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/17ee53f0aa3cebaac16ad79ae2fa79e562336dde52fe9a4fd41bdb0c7ce4a2a3.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n1) **÷, −, ×, −, =**\n\n→ **10 ÷ 2** - 1 × 8 - 11 = 8\n\n→ 5 - **1 ****×**** 8** - 11 = 8\n\n→ 5 - 8 - 11 = 8\n\n→ - 14 ≠ 8\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n2) ÷, &",
